n"},{"citationTitle":"续资治通鉴","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"黑鞑事略","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元史类编","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元史新编","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"蒙兀儿史记","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"立政议","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"陵川集","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史·郝经传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《新元史·太宗本纪》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00xys/003.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《续资治通鉴》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/01xzztj/index.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《新元史·郝经传》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00xys/167.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"太宗本紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"世纪二·太宗","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋纪一百七十","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"斡歌歹汗本纪","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"Medieval History: Mongol Invasion of Europe","url":"http://historymedren.about.com/library/prm/bl1mongolinvasion.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"The Islamic World to 1600: The Golden Horde","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20101113102742/http://www.ucalgary.ca/applied_history/tutor/islam/mongols/goldenHorde.html","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:04.159Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:yuanshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-94d492ab28186e26","query":"窩闊台","count":5,"offset":8159,"excerpt":"\n冬十月，襲金群牧監，驅其馬而還。耶律阿海降，入見帝于行在所。皇子朮赤、察合台、窩闊台分徇雲內、東勝、武、朔等州，下之。\n\n是冬，駐蹕金之北境。劉伯林、夾谷長哥等來降。\n\n七年壬申春正月，耶律留哥聚眾于隆安，自為都元帥，遣使來附。帝破昌、桓、撫等","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-d56430f1e43d850b","query":"窩闊台","count":1,"offset":36,"excerpt":"〔篇題：本紀第二〕\n〔編者說明：太宗 定宗〕\n\n太宗\n\n太宗英文皇帝，諱窩闊台，太祖第三子。母曰光獻皇后，弘吉剌氏。太祖伐金、定西域，帝攻城略地之功居多。太祖崩，自霍博之地來會喪。\n\n元年己丑夏，至忽魯班雪不只之地。皇弟拖雷來見。\n\n秋八","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-62ec7580490d37b5","query":"窩闊台","count":1,"offset":1675,"excerpt":"於軍營。〔〔也〕孫脫　據志費尼世界征服者傳譯音補。按此也孫脫為察合台之孫，曾參預窩闊台系諸王爭位密謀。〕\n\n秋七月，命忽必烈征大理，諸王禿兒花、撒（丘）〔立〕征身毒，〔撒（丘）〔立〕　撒立即下文三年六月所見「撒里」之異譯，「丘」、「立」形近致誤，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-821e00b85da01bc3","query":"窩闊台","count":1,"offset":15262,"excerpt":"在普剌東北，西人考之，謂元史憲宗本紀、耶律希亮傳之葉迷里即此也迷失。」按也迷里為窩闊台封地城名，在今新疆額敏縣東、額敏河南岸，「也迷失」疑係「也迷立」之誤。〕\n\n:阿里麻里。〔諸王海都行營于阿力麻里等處，蓋其分地也。自上都西北行六千里，至回鶻五城","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-88854e0d5f5d0324","query":"窩闊台","count":1,"offset":5870,"excerpt":"。〔從闊端攻安豐壽州　按元太宗七、八年，闊端出師秦鞏，而經略河南者為闊出。闊出，窩闊台三子，亦作「曲出」。新元史改「端」為「出」，是。〕又從諸王塔察兒率蒙古軍二千攻荊山，破之。賜馬二匹，與萬戶納䚟以兵守沂、郯，略漣海，又從元帥懷都攻襄陽。卒。\n\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:yuanshi-94d492ab28186e26","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷001","title":"元史/卷001","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7001","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2259382","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7001?action=history","revisionId":2259382,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-02-04T08:42:14Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:08.330Z","sha256":"10698700e5fb3ce190f79bfc84a181d878daf5be3196b4af882ce7f1852eb3f5","textSha256":"9a5755c9b10846ce19f60a1bcf570072b3ce4d1ff9f8bef0a302ea8ff529b630","expandedWikitextSha256":"10698700e5fb3ce190f79bfc84a181d878daf5be3196b4af882ce7f1852eb3f5","characters":12259,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/yuanshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.627Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/3da34b4d13a00261448a.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/3da34b4d13a00261448a.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:yuanshi-d56430f1e43d850b","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷002","title":"元史/卷002","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikis